      "writtenOn": "2024-06-17T22:18:31Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I see - that is pretty tricky, but the thing is - it will still fail if run concurrently, just less noticeably.\n\nWe should change RpcServer to allocate the addresses lazily like this, and then we can pull the port out of the open server instance, without breaking the FD. WDYT?",
